        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka ku oriteisa ogwo mubi, yaayanga kuruga omu bubi bwe, nari omu muhanda gwe omubi, aryafeera omu kutahikiirira kwe, kwonka iwe oryaba okirize amagara gaawe. ",
          "type": "text",
